WEBVTT

00:00.650 --> 00:05.401
Meet Nova. A browser built around the way you work.

00:06.100 --> 00:12.528
Keep your day in focus with a clean start page, flexible tabs, and separate workspaces.

00:15.100 --> 00:22.481
